Mar 30</access-date><publisher-name>U.S. Department of Health and Human Services</publisher-name><publisher-loc>Baltimore (MD)</publisher-loc><source>Centers for Medicare and Medicaid Services</source><comment>Available from: URL: <ext-link ext-link-type="uri" xlink:href="http://www.cms.hhs.gov/center/fqhc.asp">http://www.cms.hhs.gov/center/fqhc.asp</ext-link></comment></citation></ref><ref id="B6"><label>6</label><citation citation-type="book"><access-date>cited 2006 Mar 30</access-date><publisher-name>Health Disparities Collaboratives</publisher-name><publisher-loc>Rockville (MD)</publisher-loc><source>Models for changing practice</source><comment>Available from: URL: <ext-link ext-link-type="uri" xlink:href="http://www.healthdisparities.net/hdc/html/about.hdcModels.aspx">http://www.healthdisparities.net/hdc/html/about.hdcModels.aspx</ext-link></comment></citation></ref><ref id="B7"><label>7</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Wagner</surname><given-names>EH</given-names></name></person-group><volume>1</volume><issue>1</issue><year>1998</year><fpage>2</fpage><lpage>4</lpage><article-title>Chronic disease management: what will it take to improve care for chronic illness?</article-title><source>Eff Clin Pract</source><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">10345255</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B8"><label>8</label><citation citation-type="book"><access-date>cited 2006 Mar 30</access-date><publisher-name>Health Disparities Collaboratives</publisher-name><publisher-loc>Rockville (MD)</publisher-loc><source>Overview</source><comment>Available from: URL: <ext-link ext-link-type="uri" xlink:href="http://www.healthdisparities.net/hdc/html/collaborativesOverview.aspx">http://www.healthdisparities.net/hdc/html/collaborativesOverview.aspx</ext-link></comment></citation></ref><ref id="B9"><label>9</label><citation citation-type="book"><access-date>updated 2006 Jun 27</access-date><publisher-name>U.S. Department of Health and